# D3-FE-005: Yeast does not make starch an automatically fermentable sugar
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL @ 30C
add v1 sucrose 1g
add v1 dry_yeast 0.5g
add v2 water 50mL @ 30C
add v2 starch 1g
add v2 dry_yeast 0.5g
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
wait 4h
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
